manacles chains iron~
The manacles appear to be manufactured to cater for more than just your usual
humanoid.  There are four separate wristbands each on their own chain, with
the wristbands being adjustable in diameter from as thick as your leg down
to the width of two of your fingers.  They appear to have been used quite
regularly, with dark stains and rust patches competing to cover the entire
surface.
~
